PXD007758 cada2b9ff3343556 info
    No per-run `metrics` row from results.txt for `psms_1pct` (9 of 9 runs), `peptides` (9 of 9 runs), `protein_groups` (9 of 9 runs), `precursors` (9 of 9 runs), `ms2_scans` (9 of 9 runs). These counts were not written, which is not a count of zero. The search task sets `WriteIndividualFiles = false`, and MetaMorpheus writes results.txt's per-file PSM, peptide and protein-group lines only when it is true (before 1.1.14, MetaMorpheus #2955, its per-file precursor and MS2 lines too). Each run's MS2 spectra are also counted by the QC report, in `runs.ms2_spectra` and `metrics` (`name = 'ms2'`, `source = 'qc_report.json'`), for 9 of the 9 runs.
